1
00:01:58,179 --> 00:01:59,440
This turned out great.

2
00:02:04,862 --> 00:02:07,342
He can have a snack as soon
as he gets home from school.

3
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:16,365
That's strange... He's usually
back long before now...

4
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:20,054
I'm home...

5
00:02:20,078 --> 00:02:22,365
Welcome back... Huh?

6
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:26,080
What happened? You're so filthy...

7
00:02:27,004 --> 00:02:30,651
Did you get into another fight with the
bully and dilly-dally on the way home?

8
00:02:31,097 --> 00:02:35,800
Come on, take a seat... Grandpa put
his heart into making today's treat.

9
00:02:40,514 --> 00:02:42,094
How is it? Is it good?

10
00:02:43,573 --> 00:02:44,573
It's delicious.

11
00:02:45,699 --> 00:02:46,880
Good, good.

12
00:02:47,099 --> 00:02:49,519
Grandpa, am I a bad boy?

13
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:51,513
Why would you ask such a thing?

14
00:02:51,825 --> 00:02:54,240
There is no way my Mokku
could be a bad boy.

15
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:57,362
But I got into a fight at school.

16
00:02:57,704 --> 00:03:00,760
If you fought because you believed it
was right, then it couldn't be helped.

17
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:04,694
I'm sure they were teasing you just
because you're a wooden puppet.

18
00:03:05,286 --> 00:03:06,866
Mokku, come over here.

19
00:03:09,119 --> 00:03:12,799
Still, fighting isn't right. You have
to try to get along with everyone.

20
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:16,060
But they bully me...
They call me a puppet monster...

21
00:03:16,084 --> 00:03:20,016
...and say I'm impudent for studying
with humans when I'm just a puppet.

22
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:23,380
Even though I just want
to be friends with them...

23
00:03:23,646 --> 00:03:25,427
I don't want to go to school anymore.

24
00:03:25,452 --> 00:03:27,452
I just want to stay by your
side forever, Grandpa.

25
00:03:27,937 --> 00:03:30,583
If it means you can become human,
Grandpa would...

26
00:03:30,818 --> 00:03:31,818
But then...

27
00:03:32,958 --> 00:03:35,058
I'll help with your work,
Grandpa! Anything you need.

28
00:03:35,684 --> 00:03:37,260
I don't want to go to school!

29
00:03:37,614 --> 00:03:39,400
Mokku, that's no good.

30
00:03:39,584 --> 00:03:43,670
School is where you learn good
manners and study so you can
make friends with everyone.

31
00:03:43,939 --> 00:03:46,537
If you quit school now,
they'll just pick on you even more.

32
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,676
Don't worry.

33
00:03:47,701 --> 00:03:51,140
Before long, you'll make friends and
look forward to going to school.

34
00:03:51,254 --> 00:03:52,932
You just have to be patient until then.

35
00:03:53,094 --> 00:03:55,539
Okay. I'll go to school, Grandpa.

36
00:03:56,587 --> 00:03:59,322
There's a good boy. So sensible.

37
00:04:00,489 --> 00:04:03,675
Now, eat plenty so you grow strong. Eat up!

38
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,845
Now then, Mokku, watch this!

39
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,276
You damn puppet!

40
00:04:45,636 --> 00:04:46,326
Mokku!

41
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,987
Now go pick that up!

42
00:04:52,287 --> 00:04:54,222
Now then, let's begin class.

43
00:04:59,234 --> 00:05:01,414
W-Who did this?!

44
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:05,990
Mokku did it! Right, everyone?

45
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,344
Go on, tell him Mokku did it.

46
00:05:08,524 --> 00:05:10,000
Y-Yes, it was Mokku.

47
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,700
Did Mokku really do this?

48
00:05:12,375 --> 00:05:13,560
Mokku isn't even here.

49
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,837
Franco, I got the ball!

50
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:23,120
Shut up. Get lost.

51
00:05:24,619 --> 00:05:25,510
Hey, Mokku!

52
00:05:25,535 --> 00:05:26,016


53
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:28,298
Class has already started.
What were you doing?

54
00:05:28,650 --> 00:05:32,131
Playing pranks and showing up late
to class... You're a hopeless child.

55
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,920
Stand there until I say so!

56
00:05:36,293 --> 00:05:38,293
Good-bye!

57
00:05:39,268 --> 00:05:41,118
Making excuses isn't manly.

58
00:05:41,267 --> 00:05:43,900
Just be good and do your best tomorrow.

59
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:47,020
All right, you may go home for today.

60
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:49,605
Goodbye, sir.

61
00:06:19,910 --> 00:06:21,629
You're Mokku, right?

62
00:06:22,530 --> 00:06:24,405
How do you know my name?

63
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:27,820
I've known you ever since you were born.

64
00:06:28,615 --> 00:06:30,000
Huh, that long?

65
00:06:30,541 --> 00:06:34,140
Yes. I even know the teacher scolded
you and made you stand today.

66
00:06:34,495 --> 00:06:38,284
Huh, even that? But that was
because Franco and the others...

67
00:06:38,559 --> 00:06:42,312
I know that too. Mokku, I'm on your side.

68
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:45,039
Why don't you quit a school
with such bad friends?

69
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,835
How about playing with me instead?

70
00:06:47,128 --> 00:06:48,683
I know a really fun place.

71
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,611
I wonder what happened.
He's late coming home...

72
00:06:54,542 --> 00:06:56,462
Oh, the clock has stopped.

73
00:06:59,229 --> 00:07:01,874
Have you gotten old, just like me?

74
00:07:02,484 --> 00:07:04,059
Come on, follow me.

75
00:07:04,732 --> 00:07:07,244
N-N-No way. Grandpa is waiting for me.

76
00:07:07,549 --> 00:07:08,714
Come on, let's go together.

77
00:07:08,739 --> 00:07:10,039
No, I can't.

78
00:07:10,235 --> 00:07:12,430
Mokku, it's a truly wonderful place.

79
00:07:14,550 --> 00:07:15,550
Fine, see if I care.

80
00:07:18,344 --> 00:07:19,344
Wait!

81
00:07:31,082 --> 00:07:32,113
Wait!

82
00:07:32,570 --> 00:07:35,080
Huh? Where did she go?

83
00:07:35,767 --> 00:07:37,173
Over here, Mokku!

84
00:07:43,529 --> 00:07:44,880
Wait!

85
00:07:52,108 --> 00:07:53,210


86
00:08:02,207 --> 00:08:03,403
Catch me if you can!

87
00:08:22,562 --> 00:08:24,710
Call me Kathy.

88
00:08:25,515 --> 00:08:26,546
Kathy...

89
00:08:27,992 --> 00:08:30,120
...where is this fun place anyway?

90
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:32,320
I'm getting tired.

91
00:08:32,425 --> 00:08:35,843
Just a little further. Come on,
hang in there and keep up.

92
00:08:46,229 --> 00:08:47,320
I'm exhausted.

93
00:08:52,558 --> 00:08:54,645
<i>It's starting to get creepy around here.</i>

94
00:08:54,889 --> 00:08:57,140
<i>Mokku, hurry and come here.</i>

95
00:09:06,309 --> 00:09:08,400
Kathy, I want to go home.

96
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:12,308
It's all right, Mokku.
Open the door in front of you.

97
00:09:12,543 --> 00:09:14,760
A wonderful world is waiting
for you on the other side.

98
00:09:15,861 --> 00:09:17,811
But there's no door here.

99
00:09:22,829 --> 00:09:24,226
Could this be it?

100
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:39,786
Mokku...

101
00:09:42,319 --> 00:09:45,170
Mokku, you must not open that door.

102
00:09:45,757 --> 00:09:47,740
Don't you want to become human?

103
00:09:49,375 --> 00:09:51,800
T-The Oak Tree Fairy...

104
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:53,660
You must not open that door.

105
00:09:54,139 --> 00:09:56,664
I'll always be just a wooden puppet!

106
00:09:56,970 --> 00:09:59,137
If that's the case,
then turn me into a human already!

107
00:09:59,859 --> 00:10:03,633
That depends on your own efforts.
You must not rely on others.

108
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:07,439
You have to discover it with your
own eyes, with your own heart.

109
00:10:09,370 --> 00:10:11,556
You always say things like that!

110
00:10:11,682 --> 00:10:13,885
You're never going to turn me
into a human, are you?!

111
00:10:14,615 --> 00:10:18,010
Instead of that, I just want to have fun!

112
00:10:19,829 --> 00:10:22,464
Mokku! Don't! Opening that door—!

113
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,460
Wow...

114
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,522
That must be the wonderful
place she was talking about.

115
00:11:05,128 --> 00:11:08,080
That's right. It's the most
wonderful land in the world.

116
00:11:10,458 --> 00:11:12,614
For kids who are constantly
hounded to study...

117
00:11:12,818 --> 00:11:14,364
...it really is a dream paradise.

118
00:11:14,829 --> 00:11:17,083
 The most wonderful land in the world.

119
00:11:17,271 --> 00:11:18,460
A dream paradise.

120
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,926
 Are you sure it's okay not to study?

121
00:11:30,756 --> 00:11:33,852
Well hey there, pretty girl.
Are you riding in this carriage?

122
00:11:35,596 --> 00:11:38,475
Huh? It's a wooden puppet. You coming too?

123
00:11:39,296 --> 00:11:42,953
Heh, too bad there aren't
any seats open for a puppet.

124
00:11:43,351 --> 00:11:45,684
Hey, you go up on the roof!

125
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:48,297
What? The roof is full, too!

126
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,229
Shut up! When I tell you to go, you go!

127
00:11:53,036 --> 00:11:54,602
Come on in, miss.

128
00:11:56,813 --> 00:12:00,062
She's quite a looker. Let's be friends.

129
00:12:01,507 --> 00:12:04,342
Get lost! There's no room for you here!

130
00:12:04,936 --> 00:12:08,596
I have no choice. I'll ride
on Mr. Reindeer's back.

131
00:12:12,889 --> 00:12:16,898
Mokku, are you really going?
Don't do it! You'll regret it!

132
00:12:17,514 --> 00:12:19,827
All right, let's head out!

133
00:12:26,506 --> 00:12:28,926
Ha-ha! You're gonna regret this later!

134
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:33,797
♪ Ya-ha-ho! Ya-ho-ho! ♪

135
00:12:33,939 --> 00:12:36,682
♪ Ya-ho-ho! Ya-ho-ho! ♪

136
00:12:41,379 --> 00:12:42,199
All together now!

137
00:12:42,224 --> 00:12:46,967
♪ Ikou yo! Ikou! Bokura no shugi de ♪
Let's go! Let's go! On our own terms!

138
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:52,767
♪ Yukai de tanoshii paradaisu ♪
To a fun and joyful paradise!

139
00:12:52,870 --> 00:12:55,405
♪ Benkyo nante sayonara ♪
Goodbye to studying!

140
00:12:55,614 --> 00:13:00,516
♪ Gakko nante nante nai yo! ♪
There's no such thing as school!

141
00:13:00,665 --> 00:13:03,641
♪ Ikou yo! Ikou! ♪
Let's go! Let's go!

142
00:13:03,665 --> 00:13:06,264
♪ Susume yo! Susume! ♪
Press onward! Press onward!

143
00:13:06,329 --> 00:13:09,071
♪ Suteki de gokigaru ♪
Splendid and carefree!

144
00:13:09,096 --> 00:13:11,837
♪ Bokura gakusei he ♪
For us students!

145
00:13:11,915 --> 00:13:14,844
♪ Ya-ha-hey! Ya-ha-hey! ♪

146
00:13:14,868 --> 00:13:17,267
♪ Ya-ho-ho! Ya-ha-ha! ♪

147
00:13:17,733 --> 00:13:20,413
♪ Ikou yo! Ikou yo! ♪
Let's go! Let's go!

148
00:13:20,438 --> 00:13:23,686
♪ Susume yo! Susume! ♪
Press onward! Press onward!

149
00:13:24,089 --> 00:13:27,933
Yahoo! Yahoo!

150
00:14:07,559 --> 00:14:09,060
Yahoo!

151
00:14:09,849 --> 00:14:11,820
Yahoo!

152
00:14:15,070 --> 00:14:17,480
Mom, I don't need any textbooks!

153
00:14:17,577 --> 00:14:20,020
Ripping them up feels so good!

154
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,360
Just tear up every single book!

155
00:14:26,489 --> 00:14:28,858
Awesome! Let's do it too!

156
00:14:42,327 --> 00:14:43,428
Good riddance.

157
00:14:58,585 --> 00:15:00,014
Attention!

158
00:15:08,930 --> 00:15:09,930
Here...

159
00:15:10,945 --> 00:15:13,300
He's just greeting you. Say hello, Mokku.

160
00:15:20,609 --> 00:15:22,164
Urara hon rotesu.

161
00:15:22,469 --> 00:15:23,937
Burn the books!

162
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:26,580
It's a ritual to forget all about studying!

163
00:15:50,355 --> 00:15:51,498
That's the school bell.

164
00:15:51,522 --> 00:15:55,019
Now that the ritual is over,
let's all head to school!

165
00:15:55,043 --> 00:15:57,909
- School?!
- It's a super fun school!

166
00:15:57,934 --> 00:16:02,087
♪ Ikou yo! Ikou! Bokura no shugi de ♪
Let's go! Let's go! On our own terms!

167
00:16:02,112 --> 00:16:07,433
♪ Yukai de tanoshii paradaisu ♪
To a fun and joyful paradise!

168
00:16:07,616 --> 00:16:10,140
♪ Benkyo nante sayonara ♪
Goodbye to studying!

169
00:16:10,141 --> 00:16:14,642
♪ Gakko nante nante nai yo! ♪
There's no such thing as school!

170
00:16:15,659 --> 00:16:17,954
♪ Ikou yo! Ikou! ♪
Let's go! Let's go!

171
00:16:18,228 --> 00:16:20,475
♪ Susume yo! Susume! ♪
Press onward! Press onward!

172
00:16:20,979 --> 00:16:23,380
♪ Suteki de gokigaru ♪
Splendid and carefree!

173
00:16:24,427 --> 00:16:29,180
♪ Bokura gakusei he ♪
For us students!

174
00:16:36,686 --> 00:16:38,306
Hey, hurry up and do it!

175
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,680
Yeah.

176
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:54,334
Let's go! Let's go! Move it! Move it!

177
00:16:56,859 --> 00:16:58,400
This is the graffiti room.

178
00:16:59,245 --> 00:17:00,834
Here at this school,
classes work like this:

179
00:17:00,859 --> 00:17:06,020
Mondays are off, and what's more, a week
consists of six Sundays and a Monday.

180
00:17:07,532 --> 00:17:09,445
Then the whole week is time off!

181
00:17:10,137 --> 00:17:12,496
Yahoo!

182
00:17:13,009 --> 00:17:18,154
So vacation lasts from
January 1st to December 31st.

183
00:17:19,959 --> 00:17:21,599
Then that's the whole year!

184
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:26,565
Everything is backwards at this school.
Study time is playtime.

185
00:17:26,854 --> 00:17:30,049
Any child who doesn't follow that
gets scolded by the teacher.

186
00:17:30,323 --> 00:17:34,229
Now, go stu—no, go play
in those lovely classrooms!

187
00:17:39,019 --> 00:17:43,840
Let's see, let's see... I wonder if
there are any fun classrooms.

188
00:17:45,314 --> 00:17:48,544
Hey, Mokku! The science lab!
This looks fun!

189
00:18:11,399 --> 00:18:12,977
Hey, Mokku! Come look!

190
00:18:14,384 --> 00:18:16,537
A mini-monster is being born!

191
00:18:41,356 --> 00:18:42,356
I hate this!

192
00:18:45,559 --> 00:18:46,559
Help!

193
00:19:00,469 --> 00:19:04,306
Help me, Mama, Papa!

194
00:19:22,799 --> 00:19:24,329
Kathy!

195
00:19:32,556 --> 00:19:33,371
Mokku...

196
00:19:33,395 --> 00:19:35,234
...you know better than anyone that if you
leave your parents and just fool around...

197
00:19:35,259 --> 00:19:38,295
...you'll end up as nothing
more than a piece of oak scrap.

198
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:46,360
That oak is mine!

199
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:47,633
Who in the world are you?

200
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,760
I am the Poppy Fairy.

201
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,624
The Poppy Fairy?

202
00:19:52,619 --> 00:19:55,141
That's right, I'm the Poppy Fairy.

203
00:19:55,689 --> 00:19:56,887
Like hell I'll let that Oak Fairy...

204
00:19:56,911 --> 00:19:59,540
...turn you into a human with
her soft-hearted nonsense!

205
00:19:59,541 --> 00:20:00,580
I'll never let it happen!

206
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:04,642
Besides, why don't you hurry up
and turn back into a stick of wood!

207
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:14,620
Sleep. Think of nothing, deeper and deeper,
breathing in this scent of blood.

208
00:20:15,419 --> 00:20:16,697
Now, sleep....

209
00:20:17,268 --> 00:20:19,910
...and you will be just
an ordinary oak stick.

210
00:20:39,089 --> 00:20:43,028
Mokku, Mokku, you must not sleep.

211
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:46,023
Mokku, wake up.

212
00:20:46,806 --> 00:20:48,007
Open your mind's eye as well.

213
00:20:48,931 --> 00:20:51,540
Keep your heart strong and true.

214
00:20:54,711 --> 00:20:56,227
Oak Tree Fairy...

215
00:20:56,486 --> 00:21:01,558
You blockhead, so you've shown yourself!
I won't lose to the likes of you!

216
00:21:35,259 --> 00:21:37,720
Ah, is that the best you can do?!

217
00:22:36,582 --> 00:22:38,817
 Was I having a dream?

218
00:22:46,299 --> 00:22:48,720
 Look! The house is still there!

219
00:22:49,549 --> 00:22:51,161
 Grandpa is waiting for me!

220
00:22:57,351 --> 00:22:59,931
Grandpa!

221
00:23:06,449 --> 00:23:07,780
Grandpa, I'm home!

222
00:23:08,244 --> 00:23:11,900
Wh-What's the matter, Mokku?
You're awfully full of energy. Huh?

223
00:23:13,579 --> 00:23:16,900
Grandpa, I'll be a good boy from now on.
I'll go to school, too.

224
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:18,569
I see, I see.

225
00:23:21,669 --> 00:23:22,762
Grandpa...

226
00:23:23,278 --> 00:23:24,278
Mokku...

227
00:23:24,780 --> 00:23:26,157
My dear Mokku.

228
00:23:33,739 --> 00:23:38,760
<i>With the magic ring owned by the boss,
Mokku is turned into a devilish creature.</i>

229
00:23:39,754 --> 00:23:41,602
<i>A devilish creature who
does nothing but evil.</i>

230
00:23:42,992 --> 00:23:43,992
<i>On top of that...</i>

231
00:23:44,413 --> 00:23:46,005
<i>...seeking to make a profit,
the boss locks Grandfather away...</i>

232
00:23:46,030 --> 00:23:47,820
<i>...and forces him to make puppets.</i>

233
00:23:49,220 --> 00:23:52,155
<i>With the help of Giorgio,
a kindhearted crow...</i>

234
00:23:52,179 --> 00:23:56,740
<i>...will Mokku be able to regain his
good heart and save Grandfather?</i>

235
00:23:57,654 --> 00:24:00,400
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

